	quest.0000000000105670.title: "Discs by КрЛайт",
	quest.0000000000105680.quest_desc: ["Decorative pearls of the dimension: crystal lanterns in four colours, star cores and dusk light.", "Building blocks are not content, but these lights are too good to leave unspoken."],
	quest.0000000000105680.title: "Light of the Night",
	quest.0000000000105690.quest_desc: ["A KubeJS item of the pack: a starfire frame around a starlit diamond.", "Right-click grants 20 seconds of night vision and a spray of star sparks. The recipe is at the crafting table."],
	quest.0000000000105690.title: "The Stargazer's Lantern",
	quest.00000000001056A0.quest_desc: ["Floristic pearls: sacred starlight flower, whisperbloom, fire orchid, sea rosa.", "Each flower grows only in its biome - a mini-expedition apiece."],
	quest.00000000001056A0.title: "Flowers With No Home",
	quest.00000000001056B0.quest_desc: ["Six yeti furs and starfire bird aviaries: a warm floor and a living starfire farm.", "An aviary with seeds inside breeds the birds - that is how starfire renews."],
	quest.00000000001056B0.title: "Furs and Aviaries",
	quest.00000000001056C0.quest_desc: ["Lunar, northland and banyin boats with their cargo variants.", "The starlit sea is faster to cross than to walk around."],
	quest.00000000001056C0.title: "Northern Flotilla",
	quest.00000000001056D0.quest_desc: ["Scarlet, torreya, jinglestem rafts and cradlewood boats: the whole fleet.", "Jinglestem rings in the wind - music on the road."],
	quest.00000000001056D0.title: "Southern Flotilla",
